#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/priest_action.html:50
msgid "Grace"
msgstr "Gunst"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:32
msgid ""
"\n"
"              Grace is a measure of your character's standing with their "
"deity. You can receive grace by doing things\n"
"              for your deity or acting on their behalf. Grace can be used to "
"perform divine acts.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      Gunst ist ein Maß für das Ansehen deines Charakters bei seiner "
"Gottheit. Du kannst Gunst erlangen, indem du\n"
"für deine Gottheit tust oder in ihrem Namen handelst. Gunst kann verwendet "
"werden, um göttliche Taten auszuführen.\n"
"      "

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:38
msgid "Your grace is"
msgstr "Deine Gunst ist"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:54
